SUMMARY:Activating and Healing the Chakras with Yoga: Third Eye Chakra wit
 h Magi Caswell
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nAn immersion into our Chakras\, and the a
 reas of life that they govern. We will utilize different technologies of y
 oga\, breath work\, journaling\, dance\, sound\, and guided meditation. Al
 l in order to connect to these different facets of self\, through the ener
 getic portals of our Chakras.\n\nChakras are known to be energetic doorway
 s into the health\, well-being\, and state of different facets of our life
 - like belonging and safety\, connection and creativity\, or power and sel
 f- authority.\n\nIt is thought that we can access our unique relationship 
 with these different areas of our life\, through connecting with our own C
 hakras.\nWe will be communing with and balancing our Chakras through the m
 any modalities mentioned above. It should feel like a nourishing\, interac
 tive\, and explorative way to get a better understanding of where our heal
 th is in these areas of life. And through the techniques shared we will st
 rengthen and support these aspects of self.\n\nWe will start with a guided
  meditation\, followed by a journaling prompt\, we then will move into our
  movement to help access and activate our Chakra focused on that day. And 
 from here there will be a fusion of movement\, breath and sound to help mo
 ve and activate the energy within our own bodies.\n\nCapacity- 15\nPrice- 
 $11 or pay what you can
