SUMMARY:Breath Medicine: Breathwork at The Horse Shoe Farm
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**A paid event in collaboration with The 
 Horse Shoe Farm. [CLICK HERE TO REGISTER.](https://thehorseshoefarm.com/up
 coming-events/breath-medicine-breathwork-with-the-breath-nurse-23b95-rxmlg
 -44w7y-b5w75-6ad4y-kzp5x-kxgh7-36626-p227z-pejfz-bx34w-e2hgj-s6xfx-8al73-9
 28hp-5egfn)**\n\n**Your weekday evening reset**: A transformational RESET 
 Breathwork™ experience designed to boost energy\, relieve stress\, and s
 upport overall well-being. Each class weaves together breathwork\, guided 
 meditation with simple visualization\, and music for a full-body reset tha
 t leaves you feeling relaxed and recharged.\n\nWith each intentional breat
 h\, the body calms\, the mind clears\, and energy begins to shift. You’l
 l leave with a renewed sense of peace and wellness to carry into the rest 
 of your week.\n\n**This is more than a class - it’s Breath Medicine.**
