SUMMARY:Open Mic Night
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nStep into a night of creativity\, courage
 \, and community. Our Open Mic Night is a welcoming space for anyone who f
 eels called to share their voice. Whether you’re a poet\, a comedian\, a
  musician\, or someone trying out a new idea for the first time\, this is 
 your stage.\n\nBring your original poetry\, your funniest stand-up\, your 
 favorite song\, or anything else that lights you up. Performers of all exp
 erience levels are encouraged to jump in. If you’d rather soak it in fro
 m the audience\, you’re equally welcome. Expect an easygoing atmosphere\
 , plenty of encouragement\, and a room full of people ready to snap\, laug
 h\, and cheer you on.\n\n**Event Flow**\n• Sign-ups open when the doors 
 open\n• Each performer will have a few minutes at the mic\n• All style
 s and genres encouraged\n• Acoustic setups welcome\n\nThis night is abou
 t expression\, connection\, and celebrating the brave artistry that lives 
 in our Asheville community. Come share your work\, discover new voices\, o
 r simply enjoy an evening of heartfelt performances.\n\nRSVP to save your 
 spot. Performers and spectators alike are welcome.\n\nDonations are welcom
 e to support the venue.
